---
args: {"mechanisms": "AdministrativeMechanism[]", "governance": "EvidenceItem[]", "prior": "AdministrativeTrial[]"}
returns: "AdministrativeTrial[]"
---
For a supported administrative hypothesis propose a bounded approved communication/workflow change. Define a primary administrative outcome, stable denominator, observation channels, affected teams, downstream burden measure, stop condition and a decision rule before results. Do not change clinical care. Preserve actual prior trial identities and implementation receipts; a draft experiment is not an executed intervention.
